APPROVE REQUEST
----------------------------------------------------

When Admin clicks Approve

The system should

1.

Copy all information from

requested_members

into

members

table.

2.

Automatically calculate

Joining Date

Todays Date

Expiry Date

According to selected duration.

3.

Membership Status

Active

4.

Save approval date.

5.

Save approved_by (Admin ID)

6.

Delete the request OR change its status to Approved
(prefer changing status so history is maintained).

The member can now login successfully.

----------------------------------------------------
REJECT REQUEST
----------------------------------------------------

If Admin clicks Reject

Status becomes

Rejected

The request remains stored for history.

Rejected users cannot login.

----------------------------------------------------
METHOD 2 : ADMIN ADD MEMBER
----------------------------------------------------

The admin can still manually create members using

Member Management

→

Add Member

This method works independently.

Admin fills all details manually.

After saving,

The member is inserted directly into the members table.

No approval process is required.

